# Android shell build artifacts.
#
# These patterns are relative to THIS file (android/), not the repo root. They
# were previously written as `android/app/build/` etc., which .gitignore reads
# as `android/android/app/build/` — matching nothing, so the entire build output
# and Gradle cache were tracked.
local.properties
.gradle/
build/
app/build/

# Release signing material. The upload keystore is generated and held by the
# app owner and must never enter the repo — losing control of it means losing
# the ability to ship Play updates.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
